@baseUrl = https://localhost:7179

### 1) List all passengers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers
Accept: application/json

### 2) Add passenger (Deney D1: send this twice)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Nura",
  "lastName": "Çakar",
  "email": "nuray@example.com",
  "passportNumber": "TR7654321"
}

### 3) Get passenger by id: the response's ETag header is its version
# @name passengerToEdit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers/1

### 4) Update passenger. Send 3 first: If-Match carries its ETag
# Without If-Match → 428. With an old ETag (someone saved in between) → 412
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers/1
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: {{passengerToEdit.response.headers.ETag}}

{
  "firstName": "Ayşe",
  "lastName": "Yılmaz Kaya",
  "email": "ayse@example.com",
  "passportNumber": "TR1234567"
}

### 5) Delete passenger with a reservation (Restrict → 500 for now)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers/1

### 6) Non-existent passenger
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers/999

### 7) Adım 8: invalid passenger (expect 400 with errors)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "Bu soyad elli karakterden çok daha uzun olduğu için reddedilmeli mutlaka",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "passportNumber": ""
}
